data: {"text":"1. That the applicant apprehends arrest in connection with FIR No. 142/2026 dated 18.04.2026, registered at PS Doranda, under Sections BNS 318(4), BNS 336("}

data: {"text":"3) of BNS, 2023. The applicant has NOT been arrested yet but genuinely apprehends arrest and"}

data: {"text":" detention by the police authorities in the said case"}

data: {"text":" and hence seeks protection of anticipatory bail from this Hon"}

data: {"text":"'ble Court under Section 482 of BNSS, 2023.\n\n2. That the applicant apprehends arrest in connection with FIR No. 142/2026 dated 18.04.2"}

data: {"text":"026 lodged at PS Doranda, Ranchi. The said FIR has been lodged on the basis of a false and frivolous complaint by the de-facto complainant arising out of a commercial partnership dispute involving a transport business."}

data: {"text":"\n\n3. That the applicant is a well-known transporter in Ranchi and has been engaged in legitimate transport business for"}

data: {"text":" several years. The present case is nothing but a result"}

data: {"text":" of a civil commercial dispute between business partners which has been given a criminal"}

data: {"text":" colour by the complainant to harass and humiliate the applicant.\n\n4. That the applicant undertakes to cooperate fully with the investigation"}

data: {"text":" and not to leave the territorial jurisdiction of Jharkhand without prior permission of this Hon'ble Court. The applicant is always available for interrogation and has never"}

data: {"text":" avoided any legal process.\n\n5. That the applicant has been fals"}

data: {"text":"ely implicated in the present case due to malicious intent of the complainant. The allegations levelled against the applicant are completely false,"}

data: {"text":" frivolous and without any basis. The complainant has lodged the present FIR with"}

data: {"text":" ulterior motives to settle scores arising out of their commercial partnership dispute.\n\n6. That the dispute"}

data: {"text":" between the applicant and the complainant is purely civil in nature pertaining to their transport business partnership"}

data: {"text":" and the same does not involve any criminal liability. The complainant has deliberately given"}

data: {"text":" criminal colour to a purely civil commercial dispute to pressurize the applicant."}

data: {"text":"\n\n7. That the applicant is a respectable citizen with no criminal antecedents and has never been involved in any criminal case earlier. The applicant has deep roots in the community and is well"}

data: {"text":"-known in business circles of Ranchi for his integrity and honest dealings.\n\n8. That cust"}

data: {"text":"odial interrogation of the applicant is not necessary as the applicant is willing to join the investigation as and when required by the investigating agency. The applicant undert"}

data: {"text":"akes to cooperate fully with the investigation and shall not hamper the same in any manner.\n\n9. That the fundamental right"}

data: {"text":" to life and liberty as enshrined under Article 21 of the Constitution of India cannot be curtailed arbit"}

data: {"text":"rarily. The Hon'ble Supreme Court in the case of Sushila Aggarwal v. State (2020) 5 SCC 1 has laid"}

data: {"text":" down the conditions for granting anticipatory bail and emphasized that personal liberty is a precious right which should not be lightly interf"}

data: {"text":"ered with.\n\n10. That the applicant has deep roots in the community and is engaged in legitimate business activities. There is no possibility of the applicant fleeing from"}

data: {"text":" justice or tampering with evidence. The applicant has always been law-abiding and has never avoided any legal process.\n\n11. That"}

data: {"text":" the investigation in the present case is pending and the applicant apprehends that he may be arrested and"}

data: {"text":" harassed by the police authorities. Grant of anticipatory bail will ensure that the applicant's constitutional rights"}

data: {"text":" are protected while ensuring his availability for investigation.\n\n12. That in the interest of justice and to"}

data: {"text":" protect the fundamental rights of the applicant, this Hon'ble Court may be pleased to grant anticipatory bail to the applicant with such"}

data: {"text":" conditions as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper."}

